{
  "name": "Channeling Wand (4th-Level Focus Spell)",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A channelling wand is a short metal wand tipped with a Siberys dragonshard. Each wand is tied to a specific dragonmark, such as the Mark of Healing or the Mark of Making, and you can only attune to it if you possess that dragonmark.</p>\n<p><strong>Activation</strong> (Cast a Spell);</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day, plus overcharge;</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> you can cast the selected focus spell of your house at the indicated level.</p>\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply a listed-level casting of the spell; At least 25% of the crafting material value must be Siberys shards.</p>"
    },
